        "contentType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
        "pageTitle": "The AI analytics platform - Omni Analytics",
        "pageDescription": "Omni Analytics turns your data into a source of truth for AI, so anyone can get answers they trust.",
        "evidenceText": "The AI analytics platform - Omni Analytics Trusted by Get insights without waiting in line. Ask Chat like you’d ask a teammate. Refine Filter, add fields, and calculate metrics. Summarize Get insights to inform decisions. Follow up Ask another question. Context carries over. Keep exploring Start a workbook and use our full analytics UI. Make decisions faster with AI Put your analysis on autopilot. Instantly diagnose metric changes and schedule AI-written summaries to go out where your team works. Learn more Analyze drivers & drags Get insights delivered Diagnose changes Look up data quickly Use familiar analytics tools, all in one place Dashboards Custom visualizations, drill-downs, filters, and more. Spreadsheets Familiar formulas, forecasting, and modeling on top of live, governed data. Point-and-click An intuitive field picker and chart editor anyone can use. SQL Raw SQL in an IDE with intelligent autocomplete. Ship AI analytics without slowing down your roadmap White label Omni in your product with SSO embedding, APIs, and our MCP server. Get a Demo Accelerate your AI & analytics journey Our big lesson with AI is that it’s about control. When you constrain it and give it context, like Omni’s semantic layer does, you get predictable, reliable results that drive action. Data Teams Drowning in ad-hoc requests? Help users self-serve with AI they can trust, and free up time for your team. Choosing Omni is solving for more than just BI. We’ve also primed ourselves to leap forward into AI because the semantic model is at the heart of the platform. That’s not true for many other tools. Business teams Tired of waiting for answers? Ask a question with AI chat and get a response instantly. Our customers can build custom reports and dashboards in minutes without ever leaving the BambooHR platform. Our team is pushing the business forward because Omni has unlocked capacity for us. Product teams Need an AI win? Implement AI analytics with Omni in weeks instead of derailing core product work. Capture your team's knowledge in a semantic model Experts define core logic, while everyone else contributes domain expertise. AI gets better with every use. Learn more Access your semantic layer from any AI platform Query data via Omni's MCP server, APIs, and integrations. See Claude connector See ChatGPT app Set up Omni's MCP server in Cursor Set up Omni's MCP server Model data and generate AI context with agents Built-in Modeling Agent Omni's built-in agent helps you build metrics, add AI context, incorporate existing documentation, and more. Learn more Skills Invoke pre-packaged agent behaviors directly in your chat interface to build models, run queries, and manage content. Learn more Command Line Interface (CLI) Leverage Omni's suite of APIs to manage your Omni instance from the terminal. Learn more { \"model\" : { \"id\" : \"529258b9-7dbd-4bb6-8869-028a437dd384\", \"createdAt\" : \"2026-04-15T23:24:39.501Z\", \"updatedAt\" : \"2026-04-15T23:24:39.501Z\", \"deletedAt\" : null, \"connectionId\" : \"0b2493a4-b88e-4561-8285-777453c7b956\", \"name\" : \"optimize-for-ai\", \"organizationId\" : \"3cf4fd8a-29e8-408b-ac63-f9a687d0186f\", \"userId\" : \"57da3a10-45d8-449e-9a04-5d1892c0d403\", \"environmentConnectionId\" : null, \"baseModelId\" : \"8026c838-5331-45f3-a97a-cf8569da213f\", \"version\" : \"0\", \"modelKind\" : \"BRANCH\", \"hasGit\" : false, \"pullRequestUrl\" : null, \"gitSha\" : null, \"lastPrCommitAt\" : null, \"pullRequestRequired\" : false, \"branchPerPullRequest\" : false, \"createdByPrincipal\" : \"{\\\"userId\\\":\\\"57da3a10-45d8-449e-9a04-5d1892c0d403\\\",\\\"additionalContext\\\":\\\"API key id: aa30349a-5011-4cd7-9e58-58b3e78c1\\\"}\", \"disableAutoSync\" : null } } { \"model\" : { \"id\" : \"529258b9-7dbd-4bb6-8869-028a437dd384\", \"createdAt\" : \"2026-04-15T23:24:39.501Z\", \"updatedAt\" : \"2026-04-15T23:24:39.501Z\", \"deletedAt\" : null, \"connectionId\" : \"0b2493a4-b88e-4561-8285-777453c7b956\", \"name\" : \"optimize-for-ai\", \"organizationId\" : \"3cf4fd8a-29e8-408b-ac63-f9a687d0186f\", \"userId\" : \"57da3a10-45d8-449e-9a04-5d1892c0d403\", \"environmentConnectionId\" : null, \"baseModelId\" : \"8026c838-5331-45f3-a97a-cf8569da213f\", \"version\" : \"0\", \"modelKind\" : \"BRANCH\", \"hasGit\" : false, \"pullRequestUrl\" : null, \"gitSha\" : null, \"lastPrCommitAt\" : null, \"pullRequestRequired\" : false, \"branchPerPullRequest\" : false, \"createdByPrincipal\" : \"{\\\"userId\\\":\\\"57da3a10-45d8-449e-9a04-5d1892c0d403\\\",\\\"additionalContext\\\":\\\"API key id: aa30349a-5011-4cd7-9e58-58b3e78c1\\\"}\", \"disableAutoSync\" : null } } Safely launch and scale AI in your organization Data security Prevent data leakage by enforcing permissions. Branch mode Tune AI context without impacting what’s live. Git & version control Manage changes without breaking things downstream. Start analyzing with AI immediately Get started in minutes by connecting your data. Snowflake Google BigQuery Databricks dbt MCP Server git Amazon Redshift Postgres Clickhouse Trino MySQL MotherDuck Microsoft SQL Server Learn more about Omni’s integrations See Omni in Action Watch how easy it is to chat with your data and get instant, accurate answers. Schedule a 1:1 Demo Hear from our customers Priya Gupta, Head of Data at Cribl, provides self-service analytics for 700+ monthly users with Omni’s AI. She shares how she uses Git and Omni’s dbt integration to deliver insights at scale. Juliette Duizabo, Head of Data at Photoroom, discusses how her data team of 3 enables her organization of 100+ people to get answers in seconds with Omni’s AI and MCP server. Peek at what we’re building Every week, our engineers share what they’re shipping. Take a look! Table Column Virtualization Richard Czechowski Demonstrates smoother scrolling in wide data tables through column virtualization, improving rendering performance across large sets of columns and measures. Customize Null Text Display Richard Czechowski Shows how to customize the text displayed for null values in tables, including custom replacement text and inherited null-display settings from the model. Report Visualization Images Richard Czechowski Demonstrates adding query visualizations to reports as images that render when the report is generated, using the same rendering pipeline as scheduled PDF deliveries. See 11 More Demos from Last Week Read more about our approach Introducing viz layers Will Chase October 28, 2026 How I built an AI data product with Cursor and Omni Peter Whitehead October 22, 2026 When is a cheaper LLM good enough? Stephanie Jarmak October 21, 2026 \"Obviously this is just a sketch\" Steven Talbot October 6, 2026 Why the best dashboard might be no dashboard at all Jon Palmer September 28, 2026 Toward an AI harness that carries its own weight Oliver Chang September 24, 2026 View All",
