        "pageDescription": "",
        "evidenceText": "Workout Wednesday – #WorkoutWednesday Skip to content Workout Wednesday A weekly challenge to re-create data-driven visualizations. How to Participate Recreate the solution to a data-driven visualization. Challenges are released on Wednesdays (Hence the name). Re-create the solution any day you want. Download the solution at anytime. Solution walk-throughs are shared on Saturdays. They are at the bottom of the challenge. Just starting out? Our challenges range from easier to really really hard. If you are just getting started learning the platforms it can feel really intimidating. That’s why we’ve created the WOW Essentials. These are challenges for individuals just getting started. Tableau WOW Essentials → About Workout Wednesday Workout Wednesday is a weekly challenge to re-create a data-driven visualization. The challenges are designed to kick-start personal development in Tableau and Power BI. Each Wednesday a challenges are released and participants are asked to replicate the challenge that is posed as closely as possible. When you think you have it, leave a comment with a link to your visualization, share on Tableau Public, or post on Twitter for others to enjoy. map layers table calculations transparent tooltip Kyle Yetter November 10, 2026 Community Contest Shannon Lindsay November 4, 2026 Bursting Reports Scheduling Eric Heidbreder November 4, 2026 map layers Donna Coles November 3, 2026 polygon Sean Miller October 29, 2026 Advanced Deneb Kerry Kolosko October 28, 2026 Data App sigma Stanley Gai October 21, 2026 Bookmarks Intermediate Robbin Vernooij October 21, 2026 Small Multiples Lorna Brown October 20, 2026 Beginner Visualization Santhanalakshmi Ponnurasan October 14, 2026 AI Ashley Bennett October 14, 2026 Bar charts Yusuke Nakanishi October 14, 2026 Custom Visual Intermediate Andrei Khaidarov October 8, 2026 Actions Bowling Buttons Eric Heidbreder October 7, 2026 Mobile Yoshi Arakawa October 6, 2026 Intermediate Statistics Dia