alesforce Netlify Marketo Make Claude Magnolia iStock Mailchimp Hygraph Hootsuite Getty Images Hubspot n8n Google Figma Creative Force CoreMedia Adobe base44 Contentsquare Contentstack Contentful CloudCannon Comestri Conscia ButterCMS Bluestone AWS Alttext.ai Akeneo Builder.io Trusted at a Global Scale 80 billion assets under management 4 million developers and counting Thousands of the world's leading brands — from fast-growing startups to global enterprises Visionary in the Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ for DAM platforms Leader in the IDC MarketScape for Worldwide Intelligent DAM Featured in the Gartner® Market Guide™ for Video Platform Services Leader in Globe for Enterprise Video +40% reduction in asset management costs How Paul Smith Tailored Its Global DAM for Modern Commerce LEARN MORE -> 20% increase in conversions due to high quality images How Grubhub Delivers 400M Images Across Every Device LEARN MORE -> 0.5% more conversions after unlocking video for the first time Marks & Spencer Delivers Beautiful CX With Cloudinary LEARN MORE -> AI for Visual Media We’ve been AI-native since our founding in 2012. Today, that means media intelligence, specialized agents, generative editing, and content creation – AI built into every stage of the visual media lifecycle. Media Intelligence Agentic Operations GenAI Editing Media Generation Open Agent Ecosystem Understand Visual Media The intelligence layer behind every asset, automatically understanding and optimizing every visual experience. Feature Highlights: Smart Crop Intelligent optimization AI Vision LEARN MORE Automate Media Workflows Specialized agents that keep your media organized, discoverable and governed – and moving through every workflow automatically. Feature Highlights: Workflow Agent Search Agent Taxonomy Agent Moderation Agent LEARN MORE Transform Existing Media Edit, restore, or replace any part of an image or video at massive scale. Feature Highlights: Generative Fill Generative Restore Background Replace