      "title": "Award The British Cartographic Society (BCS) Awards",
      "url": "https://www.cartography.org.uk/awards",
      "category": "opportunities",
      "providers": [
        "Data Visualization Society"
      ],
      "audit": {
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T20:02:55.377Z",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "finalUrl": "https://www.cartography.org.uk/awards",
        "contentType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
        "pageTitle": "Awards | BCS",
        "pageDescription": "",
        "evidenceText": "Awards | BCS top of page BCS Annual Awards Annual sponsored awards. Winners are announced at the BCS Annual Conference In association with our sponsors, we present a series of awards for excellence in cartography that are open to everyone. Entries are encouraged from those engaged in all aspects of mapping - practical, theoretical, commercial and academic - using traditional or innovative techniques and research. ​ The awards are presented at our Annual Conference. If you have any queries, contact Jim Goldsmith our Awards Officer   New Award entry forms and rules have been updated for 2026. Award and winners entries for previous years from 2016 are available in the GeoViz Resource Centre. ​ ​ The closing date for the BCS Awards has now passed and the winners will be announced at the BCS Annual Conference in Edinburgh on 9th September. Details of 2027 awards will be announced in February 2027. BCS Awards Form 2026 Peter Jolly Award Best Map / Data Visualisation Open exclusively to BCS members for any single map or geographic data visualisation in printed or digital form. This award will be judged by BCS members. The winner will be the entry that receives the most votes. Each BCS member will be allocated one vote and in the event of a tie the BCS President will have the deciding vote The closing date for this award has now passed. Peter Jolly Award Rules 2026 Peter Jolly Award Form 2026 Stanfords Award Best entry for Printed Mapping Open to any mapping in the printed form, whether it be a poster, folded sheet map, atlas, or page from a book, etc. The Stanfords Award comprises a trophy and a certificate, and is run with the support of Stanfords map and travel book store. The closing date for this award has now passed.   Stanfords Award Rules 2026 BCS Awards Form 2026 The Collins Bartholomew Award for Thematic Mapping & Infographics Best entry for Thematic Mapping & Infographics Presented for originality and excellence in the field of thematic cartography with emphasis on effective communication of the intended theme or themes. The Collins Bartholomew Award comprises a trophy, and a certificate, and is run with the support of HarperCollins. The closing date for this award has now passed. Collins Bartholomew Award Rules 2026 BCS Awards Form 2026 Ordnance Survey Student Award Qualifying entries can be from individuals doing full or part time education courses/studies. Ordnance Survey (OS) have provided the British Cartographic Society (BCS) with an award to encourage the innovative use and visualisation of geographic data.   The award comprises a &pound;100 cash prize, a one-year subscription to the OS Maps web and mobile application, a trophy and a certiﬁcate both to be retained by the winner. The closing date for this award has now passed. ​ OS Student Award Rules 2026 BCS Awards Form 2026 The Garsdale Design Award The annual 3D Cartography Award Sponsored by GD3D&reg; the 3D geospatial brand from Garsdale Design An exciting award open to anyone creating interesting, informative, exciting 3D cartography (real or imagined) using any technique or medium! The closing date for this award has now passed. ​ Garsdale Design Award Rules 2026 BCS Awards Form 2026 Digital Mapping Award The BCS Award for digital mapping products This award is for mapping designed specifically for use in a digital environment, including, for example, digital mapping that has been enhanced using software, GIS projects, interactive web mapping and PowerPoint presentations. The closing date for this award has now passed. Digital Mapping Award Rules 2026 BCS Awards Form 2026 The Ian Mumford Award For university and college students This award is intended to encourage and recognise excellence in original cartographic research undertaken by university or college students who have been engaged in full or part-time study. The closing date for this award has now passed. Ian Mumford Award Rules 2026 Ian Mumford Award Form 2026 Tutor Recommendation Children's Map Competition Supported by Dennis Maps The BCS Children&rsquo;s Map Competition is supported by Dennis Maps &ndash; one of the world&rsquo;s leading map printers. The competition aims to encourage children&rsquo;s creativity in mapmaking through their cartographic representation of a particular theme. The awards are given every year and comprise a prize and certificate for the overall winner in each age group. The closing date for this award has now passed. CMC Award Rules & Entry Form 2026 bottom of page {\"siteFeaturesConfigs\":{\"accessibilityBrowserZoom\":{\"isBuilder\":false,\"isStudio\":false,\"isResponsive\":false},\"appMonitoring\":{\"appsWithMonitoring\":[{\"appId\":\"135c3d92-0fea-1f9d-2ba5-2a1dfb04297e\",\"isWixTPA\":true,\"monitoringComponent\":{\"monitoring\":{\"type\":\"PANORAMA\",\"panoramaOptions\":{\"project\":{\"groupId\":\"com.wixpress\",\"artifactId\":\"wix-emails-triggered-flow-cli\",\"fingerprint\":\"41e30dcc3da4793314272951f6434307dcc8030b032dfa23f6782d3f\"}}}},\"panoramaConfigByArtifactId\":{\"wix-emails-triggered-flow-cli\":{\"type\":\"PANORAMA\",\"panoramaOptions\":{\"project\":{\"groupId\":\"com.wixpress\",\"artifactId\":\"wix-emails-triggered-flow-cli\",\"fingerprint\":\"41e30dcc3da4793314272951f6434307dcc8030b032dfa23f6782d3f\"}}},\"wix-emails-module-cli\":{\"type\":\"PANORAMA\",\"panoramaOptions\":{\"project\":{\"groupId\":\"com.wixpress\",\"artifactId\":\"wix-emails-module-cli\",\"fingerprint\":\"2487a42b3d2e09620bf77631977c758ec591941a8385ee21b78275ec\"}}},\"wix-emails-analytics-cli\":{\"type\":\"PANORAMA\",\"panoramaOptions\":{\"project\":{\"groupId\":\"com.wixpress\",\"artifactId\":\"wix-emails-analytics-cli\",\"fingerprint\":\"823d0a4f82478e582aae0448e8f3ecfe74e2c2ec30b79b83084ff3ab\"}}},\"wix-emails-automations-flow-cli\":{\"type\":\"PANORAMA\",\"panoramaOptions\":{\"project\":{\"groupId\":\"com.wixpress\",\"artifactId\":\"wix-emails-automations-flow-cli\",\"fingerprint\":\"df18a835be6fd97eec5cfc161b9eab47fd0c1880