        "evidenceText": "The Fix Research &amp; Advisory 50 organizations across 15 countries since 2019 Make better media decisions Research, consulting, and practical tools for independent media and the organizations behind them. Get in touch What we do The Fix started in 2019 as a small consulting team that couldn't find the industry research it needed — so we built it ourselves. Today it's both things: The Fix Research & Advisory, working with publishers, donors and implementing organizations across Europe and beyond, and The Fix Media, a trade publication read by a community of 3,000+ senior media professionals. Since then we've delivered 40+ consulting and research projects for 50+ media organizations and funders. We helped Hromadske nearly quadruple commercial revenue during a turnaround. We've trained 309 media managers from 20+ countries through the SSE Riga media management programs. Our sector studies with JX Fund, Thomson Reuters Foundation and others have been cited by The New York Times and the Reuters Institute. And when Russia launched its full-scale invasion, we co-led a campaign that raised around €3M for dozens of Ukrainian newsrooms. The sector we work in doesn't get calm years. Funding models break — USAID's shutdown was only the loudest recent case. Platforms rewrite the rules; audiences move. So we lead the transformation. Let's work on yours. 40+ consulting & research projects 50+ media organizations 309 managers trained · 20+ countries ≈€3M raised for Ukrainian newsrooms Services & products Research Understand your market before you bet on it — audience studies, benchmarking and sector intelligence for media organizations and funders. 12 published studies · cited by The New York Times and the Reuters Institute Explore Consultancy Turn strategy into results — business models, reader revenue, product and organizational development, from audit to implementation. 30+ successful projects since 2019 Explore Publishing Stay ahead of European media 