      "id": "88e92a312e5df09cd82f1e294b7109dd3e44b141eb3e94ce5becc0874af5606d",
      "title": "How to Get a Scholarship with a Third-Class Degree: 7 Practical Steps to Improve Your Chances",
      "url": "https://opportunitydesk.org/2026/11/07/how-to-get-a-scholarship-with-a-third-class-degree-7-practical-steps-to-improve-your-chances",
      "category": "opportunities",
      "providers": [
        "Opportunity Desk"
