es is true, @propublica ? Please publish if you have ProPublica @propublica Sep 28 The CEO of defense contractor Navatek asked for a favor from Susan Collins via the head of the Collins super PAC. He said if he cut a big check, Navatek wanted Collins to guarantee tens of millions of dollars in additional federal funding. propublica.org/article/fbi-su… 11:54 PM · Sep 28, 2026 · 15K Views 18 7 12 8 cahil @cahil Sep 29 phil why are you doing susan collins bidding? wtf. 23 392 Kat @katagious2 Sep 29 Here's the Maine timeline. Kat @katagious2 Sep 26 Long before any request for funding, Navatek maintained a relationship with the University of Maine's engineering departments for nearly two decades (2000-2017) while operating primarily out of Hawaii. In 2019 Navatek opened a physical office in Portland, Maine. They signed 10 803 𝔼𝕝. 𝔼𝕝. 𝔽𝕣𝕚𝕛𝕠𝕝𝕖 @Feyesq Sep 29 July 2020 - $5,000,000. Maybe coincidence? #mepolitics composites.umaine.edu Navatek and UMaine win $5M Navy contract for research into additive manufacturing for Navy vessels... Orono and Portland, Maine — The Office of Naval Research (ONR) has awarded Navatek LLC and the University of Maine’s Advanced Structures and Composites Center (ASCC) a $5 million contract to research... 1 1 5 535",
