estigations, tools, and techniques. Plus, access to our full archive of workshop videos, slides, and transcripts. Hands-on guides to OSINT and digital investigative tools and techniques that help both professionals and motivated citizens become better investigators. Coming up: access to two self-paced online courses on OSINT and investigating digital safety. Founding Members only : A 30 min one-on-one or small group consultation or presentation per year delivered by Craig or Alexios. Tools OSINT Navigator, a database that allows investigators and researchers to search through thousands of open source intelligence tools to find the right one for your investigation. Interactive dashboards that we build as part of our investigations, including the AI Notes dashboard and Grok, is this true? trackers. Coming up: a suite of tools to power your investigations with AI part of a dedicated Lab tier , and structured access to the data underlying our investigations. Upgrade your skills and knowledge Start your membership now Join the Lab LARGE GROUP SUBSCRIPTIONS Interested in a bulk subscription package for your organization or a group discount for your class or conference? Please email us: [email protected] Discounted memberships We understand that $12.95/mo. is a substantial amount for some people. If you're between jobs, located in a lower-income economy, or otherwise unable to pay the full amount, please email [email protected] for a 1-year discounted membership rate. Indicator is your essential guide to understanding and investigating digital deception. Subscribe for free I consent to receive newsletters via email. Sign up Terms of service . ABOUT ARCHIVE UPGRADE window.__remixContext = {\"basename\":\"/\",\"future\":{\"v3_fetcherPersist\":false,\"v3_relativeSplatPath\":false,\"v3_throwAbortReason\":false,\"v3_routeConfig\":false,\"v3_singleFetch\":false,\"v3_lazyRouteDiscovery\":false,\"unstable_optimizeDeps\":false},\"isSpaMode\":false,\"state\":{\"loaderData\":{\"root\