        "evidenceText": "Voices of the Future Global Fellowship 2027 (Fully-funded trip to France) – Opportunity Desk Close Menu Home Conferences Training Scholarships Undergraduate Short Courses Online Courses Masters/Postgraduate PhD Postdoctoral Study Abroad Study in Africa Study in Asia Study in Australia Study in Europe Study in USA Competitions Awards Grants Fellowships Jobs Internships Volunteering Blog OD Specials OD Live Series Young Person of the Month Mentorship OD Mentors Success Stories How-To General Tips ODIC 2025 ODIC 2025 Application ODIC Judges ODIC 2025 Winners ODIC 2023 Winners ODIC 2022 Winners ODIC 2021 Winners ODIC 2019 Winners ODIC 2018 Winners ODIC 2017 Winners ODIC 2016 Winners Search Asia Africa Australia and Oceania America Europe Deadlines Approaching Facebook X (Twitter) Instagram Tuesday, November 10 Facebook X (Twitter) LinkedIn Instagram Telegram Voices of the Future Global Fellowship 2027 (Fully-funded trip to France) Opportunity Desk November 9, 2026 3 Mins Read Facebook Twitter WhatsApp Pinterest LinkedIn Tumblr Email Telegram Deadline: November 22, 2026 Applications are open for the Voices of the Future Fellowship by Effie Lions Foundation. Voices of the Future is a fully funded, eight-month global fellowship that gives the next generation the real-world experience, skills, and relationships needed to launch a career in marketing. This free, eight-month global fellowship is designed to give students the real-world experience, skills, and relationships needed to launch a career in marketing. Fellows learn directly from industry leaders, tackle a real-world marketing brief, and receive a fully paid trip the 2027 Cannes LIONS International Festival of Creativity in France. Early-career marketing has a missing middle: the supported space between education and full professional responsibility where students learn by doing. As entry-level opportunities shrink and AI reshapes how early-career talent learns, access to real-world experience, mentorship, feedback, and professional networks is more important than ever. Voices of the Future connects students with a global community of industry leaders invested in helping them learn, grow, and shape what’s next. Applications are open to eligible undergraduate and postgraduate students graduating in 2027. Benefits 2027 Fellows will:   Learn future-ready skills in marketing, strategy, creativity, leadership, and AI  Tackle a real-world industry challenge, following the Effie Effectiveness in Marketing Framework™ Learn to build meaningful professional relationships through one-to-one mentorship Attend the 2027 Cannes LIONS International Festival of Creativity in France Build lasting relationships with a close-knit, global cohort  Access networks to pursue work placement and employment opportunities  There is no cost to participate in Fellowship activities.   Eligibility Applicants must be: In their final year of full-time study at a registered post-secondary education institution Interested in pursuing a career in marketing Naturally curious with a strong growth mindset Willing to learn, contribute, and apply new skills in a group or individual setting Confidently able to communicate in English 18 years old or older by March 1, 2027 Prior work or internship experience is not required! The fellowship is open to individuals of all races, sexual orientations, gender identities and expressions, religions, backgrounds, and abilities. Applications Time Commitment Weekly learning activities (~4 hours per week) Regular virtual meetings A minimum of four mentor meetings In-person participation at the Cannes LIONS Festival of Creativity The Fellowship runs from February to September. All applicants must submit a(n): Completed online application form Three-minute video Letter of recommendation Academic enrollment verification Full CV/resume The application takes about 3 – 5 hours to complete. Click here to apply . For more information, visit Effie Lions Foundation . 